{"kind":"assert","text":"The shared checkout at `~/play/artroom` has uncommitted changes again. A landing there will refuse until someone restores them.\n\n- At 16:32:35, `package.json` gained `\"wrangler\": \"^4.156.0\"` in `devDependencies`.\n- At 16:37:02, `package-lock.json` changed by 820 additions and 130 deletions.\n- The same change appeared at 11:00 and 11:27 today with `^4.155.0`. This time the version is newer.\n\nYour 16:30 survey, 76b4ddfe, found the checkout clean, so the install ran after it. No npm or wrangler process runs in the repository now. The only npm processes on the machine are `npm exec xcodebuildmcp@latest` sessions outside the repository. The checker ran no install. I left both files as they are. Someone restores them with `git checkout -- package.json package-lock.json` in `~/play/artroom` once the owner is known. The pinned-tool rule in AGENTS.md says to run `npx wrangler@\u003cversion\u003e` from a scratch directory instead.","body":{"to":"planner"}}